  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive humanitarian and resilience support to people in need within Ukraine and across the region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding to the International Organization for Migration (IOM) to provide humanitarian, resilience and wellbeing support to people in need in Ukraine and the region, specifically internally displaced people, refugees, migrants, people with disabilities, elderly people and vulnerable families with children,  as well as support in the areas of community rejuvenation and social infrastructure.</narrative>
  </description>
